    ],
    "feedback": {
      "by_distractor": {
        "3 quaver rests": "Separate quaver rests show no beat at all. A dotted crotchet beat that is silent throughout takes one dotted crotchet rest.",
        "A crotchet rest, then a quaver rest": "That splits a beat that is silent all the way through. One dotted crotchet rest covers it, and shows the beat while it does.",
      },
      "correct": "Correct!",
      "incorrect": "In 12/8 a rest never runs past the end of a dotted crotchet beat, and a beat that is silent all the way through is written as one dotted crotchet rest. That gives one dotted crotchet rest.",
